        "202160004": {
          "id": 202160004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "每一次看向星空，我也会想象自己能在银河中做些什么",
          "next": [
            202160005
          ]
        },
        "202160005": {
          "id": 202160005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻，「纯美骑士」昔涟，听上去是不是很棒呢？",
          "next": [
            202160006
          ]
        },
        "202160006": {
          "id": 202160006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "思路再打开些，我是不是也很适合成为「心和猎手」？或者…无名客？",
          "next": [
            202160007
          ]
        },
        "202160007": {
          "id": 202160007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "不过，这些愿望都太奢侈啦",
          "next": [
            202160008
          ]
        },
        "202160008": {
          "id": 202160008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "我已经拥有一颗任何人都不曾有过的星星，对吧♪",
          "next": [
            202160009
          ]
        },
        "202160009": {
          "id": 202160009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "只要看着它，心怀想念，就会有光芒落在眼里",
          "next": [
            202160010
          ]
        },
        "202160010": {
          "id": 202160010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "也许，这就是我最大的心愿——",
          "next": [
            202160011
          ]
        },
        "202160011": {
          "id": 202160011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，在长长的前路上，你要永远闪耀着，好吗？",
          "next": [
            202160012
          ]
        },
        "202160012": {
          "id": 202160012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "呀，气氛是不是有些伤感了…",
          "next": [
            202160013
          ]
        },
        "202160013": {
          "id": 202160013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "那就看向天空，笑一笑吧！",
          "next": [
            202160014
          ]
        },
        "202160014": {
          "id": 202160014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "无论你去往何处，翁法罗斯的星星都会为你闪烁，就像我在向你眨眼一样~",
          "next": [
            202160015
          ]
        },
        "202160015": {
          "id": 202160015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "然后，我们一定、一定会在星光下重逢♪",
